### New Features in v22.25

- **📈 Index Fund Allocation**: Every winning trade now automatically allocates a configurable percentage (default 5%) of net profit to a randomly chosen user‑created coin. This builds your personal index fund with every transaction. The basket tracker shows acquisitions via “Index Fund”.
- **🔍 UI Scale Slider**: A new slider at the top lets you zoom the entire interface from 8px to 16px base font size. The setting persists in localStorage.
- **⏱️ Operation Latency**: Key operations (INIT, SCAN, PULL, BATCH) now record their duration and display it in a new **⏱️ OPERATION LATENCY** card. Timings are saved and shown as a time series.
- **🌐 Testnet Toggle**: Enable Binance Testnet and OKX Demo exchanges with a checkbox. They load alongside the main exchanges and follow the same parser logic.
- **📋 Copy Logs Button**: One click copies the entire log panel to your clipboard for easy sharing.
- **ℹ️ Live Wallet Tooltip**: Hover over the info icon next to the VIRTUAL/LIVE toggle to see a brief explanation of how live execution works.

This update adds a reliable one‑click log copy that won’t be interrupted by live WebSocket updates, a pause‑logs toggle for manual selection, deeper pump.fun and Uniswap integration with quick‑select buttons, and a custom token launcher for your Pump.fun testnet.

