- **📋 Uninterrupted Log Copy**: The **COPY** button now uses a hidden textarea fallback, instantly capturing all log text without being disrupted by live WebSocket updates. A **⏸️ Pause Logs** checkbox freezes the log display, allowing you to manually select and copy without new entries pushing your selection.
- **🦄 Pump.fun & Uniswap Priority**: A new **🚀 PUMP** button (unlocked at Level 7) opens a dedicated Pump.fun token launcher with configurable API endpoint. A **🦄 Uniswap** quick‑select button has been added to the graph controls, and a new “Uniswap V2 (DexScreener)” exchange fetches UNI‑based pairs.
- **🧪 Testnet Enhancements**: The testnet toggle now includes **Pump.fun Devnet** alongside Binance Testnet and OKX Demo. Pump.fun devnet uses the same parser but can be pointed at a custom API via the Pump Launch modal.
- **🔍 UI Scale Persistence**: The scale slider setting is now saved in localStorage and restored on reload.
- **⭐ Level‑Gated Pump Launch**: The Pump.fun launch feature is unlocked at Level 7 and grants +100 matrix points on use, encouraging progression.

---

**Optimization Tip:** You can customize the Pump.fun API URL in the launch modal – point it at your own backend. The pause‑logs feature is a simple toggle; use it whenever you need to inspect or copy the log history.

This update adds a **Simulated Live Execution** pipeline with mock transaction IDs, a dedicated **Live Trades** history panel, exchange API‑key support, and a richer proxy rotation list – making the live‑mode workflow fully testable without an external server.

